      "extractedText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Igumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR I.T. EQUIPMENT FOR USE OF\nTREASURER’S OFFICE\n1. The Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Account Number 1091-1-07-05-030, Budget Year 2018 intends to apply\nthe sum of P 210,000.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to\npayments under the contract for Supply and Delivery of Various I.T. Equipment for\nuse of Treasurer’s Office, Miagao, Iloilo. Bids received in excess of the ABC shall be\nautomatically rejected at bid opening.\n2. The Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM NO. | QUANTITY | UNIT ITEM DESCRIPTION\n1 2 Set | Desktop Computer with Printer\nProcessor: 2.4 GHz\nATX case with 600 PSU\n4GB DDR4 memory\n1TB SATA\nUSB keyboard\nUSB optical wheel mouse\n18.5 LED monitor 500 watts AVR\nPRINTER\nMulti-function (Print Scan Copy Printer)\nUPS\n650 VA\n2. 1 Unit | Laptop\nProcessor: 2.6 GHz\n8GB memory\n1 TB storage\n2Gb dedication video card\n3. 4 Unit | Printer\nDOT MATRIX\n4, 8 Unit | UPS\n650 VA",
